   "kind": "fact",
   "text": "At ADD-03, the effective text of VOL-II 1.4 still says that the Authority provides a grid connection point at the site boundary and that the Project Company procures all other utilities. The conditional deletion in ADD-03 7.2(a) is not shown as applied.",
