    {
     "doc": "VOL-II",
     "unit_id": "VOL-II:1.4",
     "page": 2,
     "kind": "span",
     "words": "The Authority will provide the site free of encumbrance, together with a grid connection point at the site boundary. All other utilities shall be procured by the Project Company.",
     "cell": null,
     "crop_sha256": null
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "id": "S-I-14-COND",
   "kind": "interpretation",
   "text": "If ADD-03 Section 7 takes effect, the words about the Authority's grid connection point are deleted. The grid connection would then fall under 'All other utilities' and the Project Company would have to procure it. Until the trigger is decided, the row stays conditional.",
