  {
   "id": "S-I-DN-VEL",
   "kind": "interpretation",
   "text": "Rough check: 2.083 m3/s through a 1.2 m bore is about 1.84 m/s, which is above the new 1.5 m/s limit. At 1.5 m/s the bore needed is about 1.33 m. So DN1200, the stated minimum, may not be enough for the whole main, including the trenchless crossings. This is not an approved calculation: the internal diameter after lining is not stated in the pack, so the figures are indicative only. Insufficient evidence to fix the required diameter.",
