     "note": "ADD-03 5.2 amends ADD-01 5.1 with effect from 8 October 2026. GRP is still acceptable for buried sections, subject to the whole-life cost comparison, but not at the trenchless crossings in VOL-II 5.4, where only ductile iron may be used. Ductile iron is still the default material, and the applicable international standard is still not named."
